      "path": "/projects/0/description",
      "value": "Integrated SAP systems with ServiceNow using OAuth 2.0 authentication and REST APIs to securely retrieve and provide seamless data flow between SAP and ServiceNow platforms. Developed interactive ServiceNow dashboards and reports with dynamic content blocks and filters, enabling real-time data analysis and decision-making. Designed and enforced data validation rules and transformation logic to implement bulk data import solutions using Import Sets and Transform Maps to process Excel data into ServiceNow tables. Managed roles and access controls, developed and deployed user surveys.Contributed to seamless ServiceNow operations, enhancing platform performance, user experience, and workflow automation. Created Scheduled Job for emails and reports. Led end-to-end client engagement, from requirement gathering to designing and delivering effective technical solutions.",
